BT 1 0 0 1 0 69.9 Tm /F1 9.3 Tf 13.2 TL (Migrating production code across sibling HTTP libraries is deceptively difficult for Large Language Models and) Tj T* (Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\) agents. Unlike cross-language translation where syntax forces structural rewrites,) Tj T* (sibling libraries in the same ecosystem intentionally mirror one another's surface ergonomics while redesigning implicit) Tj T* (stateful defaults. When a developer agent edits a workflow module \(workflow_steps.py\) without retrieving the cross-file) Tj T* (session factory \(session_setup.py\), local syntax checks and unit mocks pass while live multi-step wire exchanges fail) Tj T* (silently at Step k.) Tj T* ET
